### ============================================================
### 认证接口 HTTP Client 测试集
###
### 支持工具（点请求旁 ▶ 即可发送）：
###   • IntelliJ IDEA / WebStorm  内置 HTTP Client（推荐）
###   • VS Code / Cursor          安装 REST Client 插件（humao.rest-client）
###
### 环境变量：同目录 http-client.env.json
###   IntelliJ：右上角选择 dev / direct 环境
###   VS Code REST Client：在 settings 中配置 rest-client.environmentVariables
###     或将下方 @baseUrl 取消注释作为默认值
###
### 验证码 {{code}}：发码后从邮件查看，或 Redis：
###   docker exec redis redis-cli GET "email:code:REGISTER:{{newEmail}}"
### Mock 模式：.env 设 EMAIL_MOCK_ENABLED=true 时固定为 123456
### ============================================================

# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
# @existingEmail = 3100672662@qq.com
# @newEmail = test-register@qq.com
# @password = abc123
# @wrongPassword = wrong1
# @code = 123456


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 1. send-code 发送验证码
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 ✅ 注册发码成功
### 预期: code=200, data.expireIn=300
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "bizType": "REGISTER"
}

> {%
  client.test("注册发码成功", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "HTTP 200");
    client.assert(response.body.code === 200, "业务码 200");
    client.assert(response.body.data.expireIn === 300, "expireIn=300");
  });
%}

###

### 1.2 ✅ 找回密码发码成功（邮箱须已注册）
### 预期: code=200, data.expireIn=300
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "bizType": "RESET_PASSWORD"
}

###

### 1.3 ❌ 缺少邮箱
### 预期: code=400, message="请输入邮箱"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

###

### 1.4 ❌ 邮箱格式错误
### 预期: code=400, message="请输入正确的邮箱格式"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "bizType": "REGISTER"
}

###

### 1.5 ❌ MX 域名无效（EMAIL_MX_CHECK_ENABLED=true）
### 预期: code=400, message="邮箱域名无效或无法接收邮件"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user@invalid-domain-xyz123.fake",
  "bizType": "REGISTER"
}

###

### 1.6 ❌ 注册发码 - 邮箱已注册
### 预期: code=409, message="该邮箱已被注册"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "bizType": "REGISTER"
}

###

### 1.7 ❌ 找回密码发码 - 邮箱未注册
### 预期: code=404, message="该邮箱未注册"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody-not-exist@qq.com",
  "bizType": "RESET_PASSWORD"
}

###

### 1.8 ❌ 60 秒内重复发送（需先执行 1.1 后立即再发）
### 预期: code=429, message 含 "发送过于频繁"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "bizType": "REGISTER"
}

###

### 1.9 ℹ️ bizType 省略（按 REGISTER 处理）
### 预期: code=200 或 409（若邮箱已注册）
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}"
}

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 2. register 注册
### 先执行 1.1 发码，将 {{code}} 填入 env 或 http-client.env.json
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 ✅ 注册成功
### 预期: code=200, data.email 与请求一致
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

> {%
  client.test("注册成功", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.data && response.body.data.email);
  });
%}

###

### 2.2 ❌ 验证码错误
### 预期: code=400, message="验证码错误"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "code": "000000"
}

###

### 2.3 ❌ 验证码过期/未获取
### 预期: code=400, message="验证码已过期，请重新获取"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "fresh-never-sent@qq.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### 2.4 ❌ 密码格式不合法（少于 6 位）
### 预期: code=400, message="密码为 6-10 位数字、字母或特殊字符"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "password": "abc",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

###

### 2.5 ❌ 验证码非 6 位数字
### 预期: code=400, message="验证码为 6 位数字"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{newEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "code": "12"
}

###

### 2.6 ❌ 重复注册
### 预期: code=409, message="该邮箱已被注册"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 3. login 登录
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 ✅ 登录成功（自动保存 accessToken，Cookie 由客户端管理）
### 预期: code=200, data.accessToken, data.accessExpiresIn=1800, Set-Cookie: game_community_refresh_token
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
  client.test("登录成功", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.data.accessToken, "有 accessToken");
    client.assert(response.body.data.accessExpiresIn === 1800);
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
  });
%}

###

### 3.2 ❌ 邮箱未注册
### 预期: code=404, message="该邮箱未注册"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "notexist-{{$uuid}}@qq.com",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

### 3.3 ❌ 密码错误
### 预期: code=401, message="密码错误"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "password": "{{wrongPassword}}"
}

###

### 3.4 ❌ 缺少密码
### 预期: code=400, message="请输入密码"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}"
}

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 4. reset-password 找回密码
### 先执行 1.2 发码，填写 {{code}}
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 ✅ 重置密码成功
### 预期: code=200, data=null，并清除 refresh Cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

###

### 4.2 ❌ 验证码错误
### 预期: code=400, message="验证码错误"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{existingEmail}}",
  "password": "{{newPassword}}",
  "code": "000000"
}

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 5. refresh 刷新 Token
### 须先执行 3.1 登录（同一会话 Cookie 自动携带）
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 ✅ 刷新成功
### 预期: code=200, data.accessToken, data.accessExpiresIn=1800
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

> {%
  client.test("刷新成功", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.code === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.data.accessToken);
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
  });
%}

###

### 5.2 ❌ 无 Cookie
### 预期: code=40102, message="refreshToken Cookie 不存在或已失效"
### 注意：若刚登录过，请先新开 Run Configuration 或清除 Cookie 再测
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

###

### 5.3 ❌ 伪造 refreshToken
### 预期: code=40102, message="refreshToken 无效"
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json
Cookie: game_community_refresh_token=invalid.token.here

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 6. logout 登出
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 ✅ 登出成功（建议先执行 3.1 登录）
### 预期: code=200, data=null
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

###

### 6.2 ✅ 未登录登出（幂等）
### 预期: code=200
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/auth/logout
Accept: application/json

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 7. 网关鉴权（需登录接口示例）
### 先执行 3.1 登录，再测 7.2
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 ❌ 无 Token 访问受保护接口
### 预期: HTTP 401, code=40101, message="请先登录"
GET {{gatewayHost}}/user/me
Accept: application/json

###

### 7.2 ✅ 带 Token 访问（使用 3.1 保存的 accessToken）
### 预期: code=200
GET {{gatewayHost}}/user/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 7.3 ✅ 修改昵称（异步审核，立即返回 pending）
PUT {{gatewayHost}}/user/username
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "username": "新昵称测试"
}

###

### 7.4 ✅ 修改个性签名
PUT {{gatewayHost}}/user/signature
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "signature": "这是一条个性签名"
}

###

### 7.5 ✅ 上传头像（multipart，≤5MB）
POST {{gatewayHost}}/user/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 8. 推荐测试顺序（全流程）
### 按顺序点击 ▶：1.1 → 填 code → 2.1 → 3.1 → 5.1 → 6.1 → 5.2(40102)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
